# The checks every pull request into main must pass: the input of
# tools/ruleset/ruleset, which turns this list into the branch ruleset.
#
# One check per line: the id of the app that reports it, a space, then the
# check's name exactly as GitHub shows it on a pull request. 15368 is GitHub
# Actions, so a status that any other app or token posts under the same name
# does not count.
#
# all-tests (.github/workflows/tests.yml) is the one check: it calls every
# test workflow that a change touches and fails unless each one it called
# passed. install/test/ruleset.test.sh holds this list against
# .github/workflows/: each name here must come from exactly one job there, and
# every job that runs on pull requests must be listed, or be one that a listed
# job needs.
15368 all-tests
